<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Escelsa 1996 net vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Escelsa 1996 net vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian power utility company Escelsa, based in Espirito Santo state, has issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			    1996			   1995</p>
<p>    shr profit	  17.62 reais	 loss   21.95 reais</p>
<p>    net profit	  80.1 million	    loss   99.8 million</p>
<p>    operating revs    458.3 million		    369.7 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
